Single-database configuration for Flask.

This directory was hand-authored to match the standard structure produced
by `flask db init` (Flask-Migrate), because the flask-migrate/alembic
packages could not be installed in the sandbox used to author Phase 2 (no
network access). Before relying on this in a real environment, run:

    pip install -r requirements.txt
    flask db init

...pointed at a scratch directory and diff the result against this
`migrations/` folder to confirm they match your installed Flask-Migrate
version's exact template output. Functionally, `env.py` and
`script.py.mako` here are the stable, well-known Flask-Migrate templates
and have not been customized beyond the standard wiring to `database.db`.
